      334        "Договоры" VIEW-AS TEXT
      335             SIZE 14.6 BY .67 AT ROW 1.27 COL 42
      336             FGCOLOR 4
      337       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
